    "created_at": "2017-01-21T10:30:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-21T10:30:03Z",
    "body": "So if we need this that means that promises are fundamentally incompatible with Indexed DB's transaction model (I somewhat recall us reaching that conclusion many years ago). Is that acceptable?\r\n\r\nAlso, reading https://github.com/w3c/IndexedDB/issues/87#issuecomment-270206336 it seems like this \"cleanup step\" can be associated with the current task. You don't need a hook at the event loop level.\r\n\r\n(While reviewing the issue I also found https://github.com/w3c/IndexedDB/issues/140. 😟)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
