    "updated_at": "2017-01-25T05:03:52Z",
    "body": "Isn't it a problem that \"clean up after running script\" is also run after each microtask queued by JavaScript's EnqueueJob?\r\n\r\nAlso, I thought the event dispatch case was something you could handle yourself. Set the flag. Dispatch the event. Unset the flag. There doesn't seem to be a problem there necessarily or am I missing something?",
